  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BBVA Argentina SL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The most significant expected Project-level outcome is increased access to finance for SMEs in Argentina. Beyond this outcome, IFC anticipates that the Project will enhance the resilience of the SME financing market by easing structural barriers to long-term credit, enabling banks to build more sustainable SME portfolios, and helping restore the sectors capacity to manage long-term risk.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment consists of a senior unsecured A Loan of up to US$150 million to Banco BBVA Argentina S.A. (BBVA Argentina or the Bank) to support the expansion of its small and medium enterprises (SMEs) lending program in Argentina (the Project).</narrative>
  </description>
